## 1. About the Project

MeowMusic is a Telegram voice-chat music bot. It is built on Python and
Pyrogram-based tooling and includes modules for:

- Playing music and videos in Telegram voice and video chats
- Queue, skip, pause, resume, seek and playback controls
- Playlist and search support
- Welcome, leave and group-management tools
- Admin, approval and bot-management commands
- Assistant (userbot) account handling for voice-chat playback

The project is intended for personal, educational and community use.

